e6h50PGYHFj__gDOeOojzC2pXhzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRPeCMkjW9Ano0y0i0jK-kH_RPSgSMn3ixSX2nuFSnarQ&oe=6AFC9321"}, "display_name": "Rhythm Racket - Demo", "keywords": ["beat", "rhythm", "music", "racket", "swing"], "long_description": "# Swing your racket to the beat!\nI took the badminton mod from Beat Saber and turned it into a full rhythm game! Experience flow as you swing, smash, and return volleys to the beat of the music.\n\nGet the full game here \u2192 https://vr.meta.me/s/1S5C9g6vEST6p3Q\n{1248197004069725}\n{1296455139059008}\n\n# Work up a sweat!\nJust 4 note types and 3 lanes combine to create complex patterns.\n{1985013245383485}\n{1924103911582438}\n\n# 3 soundtracks to try out!\nWith 10+ in the full version!\n{964566906128340}\n\n# Audience reacts to your performance!\nWatch the audience cheer in excitement during perfect swings.\n{955582563645192}\n\n# Aim for a Million!\nAim for a max score of 1,000,000 on each soundtrack to earn M rank.\n{27057277030541176}\n\n# Discover artists with banger tracks!\nFrom rhythm game artists like **t+pazolite** (Arcaea, DEEMO, & Cytus II) and **Nstryder** (osu!, Geometry Dash, & Sound Space).\n{2110782169763378}\n\nNote: Progress does not carry over to full game.", "short_description": "Swing your racket to the beat!"}]}, "developer_name": "Allen Dawodu", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tadalands.com/rhythm-racket/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tadalands LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tadalands.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT